 "lines": {
  "Adeline! Thank goodness you're here.": "merlin_0.ogg",
  "Goblins are causing trouble all over our island. They work for the ogre across the water.": "merlin_1.ogg",
  "Pick a mission and I'll tell you what to do.": "merlin_2.ogg",
  "The goblins are east of here, past the signpost.": "merlin_3.ogg",
  "Watch what a goblin does before it attacks. It always gives itself away.": "merlin_4.ogg",
  "You did it! The island is safe again.": "merlin_5.ogg",
  "Here is your reward: the Magic Shield.": "merlin_6.ogg",
  "Tap SHIELD just before an attack lands and it will bounce right off.": "merlin_7.ogg",
  "Head east past the signpost and send those goblins packing.": "merlin_8.ogg",
  "Your wand strikes fast up close. Your fireball hits three times as hard, but it needs a moment between casts.": "merlin_9.ogg",
  "The ogre has locked your mother and father in his fort on the island across the water.": "merlin_10.ogg",
  "Its gate only opens when two stones are pressed at the very same moment. Nobody can do that alone.": "merlin_11.ogg",
  "Fetch your little sister. Then take the flying boat at the river.": "merlin_12.ogg",
  "You brought them home! I never doubted the two of you for a moment.": "merlin_13.ogg",
  "A unicorn fell out of the sky last night. I saw her rainbow streak down over the eastern meadows.": "merlin_14.ogg",
  "The goblins will want her magic. Find her before they do.": "merlin_15.ogg",
  "Take your little sister. Only the very young can see a unicorn's hoofprints.": "merlin_16.ogg",
  "Her hoofprints lead east, past the signpost. Keep your sister close and she will spot them.": "merlin_17.ogg",
  "A unicorn in our own stable! The sky belongs to the two of you now.": "merlin_18.ogg",
  "A unicorn? A real one? I'm coming!": "sl_0.ogg",
  "She says thank you! The goblins scared her and now she can't find her way home.": "sl_1.ogg",
  "Her home is up in the clouds. Can we take her? Please, please, please?": "sl_2.ogg",
  "She doesn't want to say goodbye. She wants to come and live with us!": "sl_3.ogg",
  "Mom and Dad? Then I'm coming too!": "sl_4.ogg",
  "My pony is small but she is ever so fast. To the boat!": "sl_5.ogg"
 },
